      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "## H3 latent stitch\nUse only an exact MMH3 continuation lineage: every segment after the first must name the immediately previous packet / latent resource / latent revision as its source. FL2VA and Ref2VA segments may be mixed inside that lineage. Keep video/audio handover equal on an exact shared AV boundary (39, 90, 141, ...); the node trims that duplicated joint-AV prefix in latent space. Independent or skipped latents are rejected. After stitch, stock Video/Audio VAE decode runs once for the assembled timeline."
      ]
    }
